      "text": "02 — PROJECTS",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2905,
      "y": -1142,
      "text": "Things I make",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 64
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.dek",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3110,
      "y": -1018,
      "text": "Graphics from first principles, games that are mostly art,\nand the board you're standing on.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.g.label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2662,
      "y": -304,
      "text": "01 / GRAPHICS",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.g.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2882,
      "y": -254,
      "text": "A renderer, from scratch",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.g.body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2858,
      "y": -148,
      "text": "I like knowing where every pixel comes from.\nSo I write the renderer in C and push bytes\ninto the framebuffer myself.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.g.code",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2806,
      "y": 48,
      "text": "void blit(u32 *fb, int fbw, const u32 *src,\n          int w, int h, int dx, int dy) {\n  for (int y = 0; y < h; y++) {\n    u32 *row = fb + (dy + y) * fbw + dx;\n    const u32 *s = src + y * w;\n    for (int x = 0; x < w; x++)\n      if (s[x] >> 24) row[x] = s[x];\n  }\n}",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.g.figma",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2864,
      "y": 232,
      "text": "Also: reverse-engineering Figma's C++ engine,\njust to see how it stays that fast.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.heroes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4365,
      "y": -388,
      "text": "← art direction heroes",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.c.label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3698,
      "y": -304,
      "text": "02 / GAMES",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.c.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3791,
      "y": -254,
      "text": "Compact Disc",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.c.body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3914,
      "y": -164,
      "text": "A web game where everything you see is 3D art\nI made: models, levels, lighting, the mood.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.c.link",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": -96,
      "text": "[play it ↗](https://{{url}})",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.w.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3849,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "{{Winamp walker}}",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.w.body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3908,
      "y": 92,
      "text": "A strange 3D walking simulator that lives\ninside a Winamp skin. All art, no apologies.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.w.ref",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3962,
      "y": 318,
      "text": "← the reference",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.terminal.text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5029,
      "y": -648,
      "text": "$ cat details.txt\n\n· playback is a pure function of time\n· zoom lerps in log space, feels linear\n· tours contain-fit to any screen\n· grab it mid-tour: pause. play: ease back\n· frames skip React, commit at rest\n· the CMS is one JSON file",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.s.label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4767,
      "y": -304,
      "text": "03 / THIS SITE",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.s.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4876,
      "y": -254,
      "text": "This whiteboard",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.s.body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4987,
      "y": -148,
      "text": "A DOM infinite canvas, an editor that saves to\none JSON file, and a tour that's camera keyframes\nriding an audio clock. Built from scratch.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "projects.s.link",
