      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.kicker",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5327,
      "y": -1232,
      "text": "03 — THINKING",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5142,
      "y": -1142,
      "text": "How I think",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 64
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.dek",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4951,
      "y": -1018,
      "text": "Design engineering in the AI era, in five opinions.\nLoosely held, loudly stated.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.quote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5052,
      "y": -786,
      "text": "AI made average free.\nTaste is the moat.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t0.n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5381,
      "y": -562,
      "text": "01",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t0.a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5064,
      "y": -562,
      "text": "Taste is the bottleneck now.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t0.b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5034,
      "y": -512,
      "text": "Generation is cheap. Knowing what's good isn't.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t1.n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5381,
      "y": -422,
      "text": "02",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t1.a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5134,
      "y": -422,
      "text": "The handoff is dead.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t1.b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5028,
      "y": -372,
      "text": "Mocks thrown over a wall lose half their intent.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t2.n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5381,
      "y": -282,
      "text": "03",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t2.a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5028,
      "y": -282,
      "text": "Design engineers close the loop.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t2.b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4981,
      "y": -232,
      "text": "Feel it, find what's wrong, fix it in the real material.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t3.n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5381,
      "y": -142,
      "text": "04",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t3.a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5020,
      "y": -142,
      "text": "Product engineering ate the mock.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t3.b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5040,
      "y": -92,
      "text": "The prototype is the product now, so craft it.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t4.n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5381,
      "y": -2,
      "text": "05",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t4.a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5134,
      "y": -2,
      "text": "Ship the real thing.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.t4.b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5163,
      "y": 48,
      "text": "Nobody uses a Figma file.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.why.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3621,
      "y": -834,
      "text": "Why I build",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.why.body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3474,
      "y": -712,
      "text": "I want work that's hard and real: a team with\nactual initiative, building something that\nshould exist. That's where the interesting\nproblems are, and where craft actually matters.",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.bs.title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3621,
      "y": -514,
      "text": "BS / not BS",
      "font": "sans",
      "fontSize": 32
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.bs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3621,
      "y": -372,
      "text": "BS\n\nvelocity theater\nmocks nobody builds\n\"AI will replace taste\"\nmeetings about meetings",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.notbs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3201,
      "y": -372,
      "text": "NOT BS\n\nshipping\nreading the source\nsweating 1px\nsmall teams, big swings",
      "font": "mono",
      "fontSize": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "thinking.argue",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3606,
      "y": -146,
      "text": "(argue with me)",
      "font": "handwritten",
      "fontSize": 40
    },
